; Story question: who rules Varrow at tick -190, and what is the ruler's name?
; Derivation: tomas ruled from -350 and was retracted at -190; hild is asserted at
; the same tick -190. The intervals touch ([-350,-190), [-190,inf)), so at -190 only
; hild holds. Hild's name is "Hild".
[:find ?r ?n :at -190 :where [:varrow :ruled_by ?r] [?r :name ?n]]
